  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food Production and Resilience of Food Systems in the Caribbean</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In the context of the current global food security crisis exacerbated by the Russian war in Ukraine, the Action will enhance the resilience and sustainability of agri-food systems, benefiting the most vulnerable countries in the Caribbean region. The Action will include short term and medium-long term responses to help the most vulnerable cope with the crisis, while contributing to sustainable and resilient food systems at the national and regional level.</narrative>
  </description>
